russh 0.65.0
Upstream: https://github.com/Eugeny/russh
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE is distributed with russh.

Newport modifies russh's channel and session code to add per-channel flow
control: a channel's receive window reopens only as its reader takes data,
and output waiting on a peer's window is held back per channel instead of
blocking the session. It also confirms channel closes to the handler. The
changed files are src/channels/channel_ref.rs, src/channels/io/rx.rs,
src/channels/mod.rs, src/client/encrypted.rs, src/client/mod.rs,
src/client/session.rs, src/deferred.rs, src/lib_inner.rs,
src/server/encrypted.rs, src/server/mod.rs, src/server/session.rs and
src/session.rs. All other published package files remain unchanged.
